// Verified MIR -> OptIR lowering, Cooper-Harvey-Kennedy dominator tree & dominance frontier,
// minimal SSA construction (with Copy/Move value sharing and SROA field projection),
// MemorySSA (LiveOnEntry, MemoryPhi, MemoryDef, MemoryUse), three-valued certainty lattice
// (Proven / Possible / Unknown) with ProofProvenance, and OptIR -> MIR reconstruction (T601 / E15.1).
// Implements SPEC-70 (REQ-OPT-337, REQ-OPT-338, REQ-OPT-340, REQ-OPT-341, REQ-OPT-390..392, REQ-OPT-397..403).
module compiler.opt.optir

